# Brimaz, King of Oreskos blocks Craw Wurm (6/4). Its AttackerBlocked trigger
# creates a 1/1 Cat Soldier "that's blocking that creature" (TokenBlocking$
# TriggeredAttacker): SpellAbilityEffect.addToCombat's blocking half
# (SpellAbilityEffect.java:795-829) adds the token as a blocker of the Wurm
# with no legality check. The Wurm is already blocked, so AttackerBlocked does
# not run again (no second token). In the damage step the Wurm assigns all 6
# to Brimaz (queue damage names fixture cards only; the token gets none), and
# Brimaz's 3 plus the Cat Soldier's 1 kill the 4-toughness Wurm -- the token
# dealt combat damage as a blocker.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
resolvestack
advance
advance
queue damage 2=6
combatdamage
# The end of combat step's state-based check puts the dead in graveyards.
advance
